Iraq and Syria, or ISIS.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.710
A well-oiled governmental
and military organization

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.670
run by many of the military leaders

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:22.670
who were ousted by the Americans
from the Iraqi military

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.140
when they took over Baghdad.

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:27.470
So Iraq turns into the US trying to fight

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.530
